a2a0e8e0ad945edf4831fea7e37eaea61cb1e","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Yes","source_tag":"_t","target":"是"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"76545a6d28aaaf0fb5237ee2f36916e6efd776f4911ccebd9992f788dcfd7cbc","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"da314f99019a0d5d41844742d62476659a90e04ee9dd6c7993a39ffd85c25a26","logical_entry_identity":"a635b3778ea1f97fb12db71224e532eb2fc6f4ab272109cde85ebb3175d5b369","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"darkness","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"暗影"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0ec40c56121cdf1132b483f26a46bf7e0a14fb372883f0f78b53dc86f8d894a3","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"dac57e56ba34a2eab7c2d776820329f1c6b1c68f55a99aa7a2a3808158734466","logical_entry_identity":"7db9a2c914286cc8dada361de7bf5453c6d92deaf68d8946be791c9686e5c058","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#{italic}#This note is stained with what appear to be motorcycle tire-tracks.#{normal}#\n\n#{bold}#URGENT:#{normal}#\n\nOperation to secure <?=player.name?> failure.  Primary defense force routed by target's overwhelming badassery, secondary team presumed dead (reports inaudible over sound of face-melting guitar solos).  All is lost.  Totally worth it.  Highest priority is now isolating <?=player.name?>, building a stadium around <?=player:him_her()?>, and selling tickets to spectacle of badassery.  Blow all connectors, break platform off the continent, prepare pyrotechnics, and set up spotlights and speaker systems befo--\n\n#{italic}#The last O trails off, a line leading from it to the end of the page like the pen was rapidly jerked away, then leads to a doodle depicting you, wielding a double-bladed katana and fighting a giant construct labelled \"Ninja Atamathon.\"  Your badassery must have interrupted this demon's writing.#{normal}#\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#这张便条被摩托车轮胎的痕迹弄脏了。#{normal}#\n\n#{bold}#紧急事项：#{normal}#\n\n对 <?=player.name?> 的保全监禁计划失败。主要防御力量被他的霸气侧漏吓退，应急部队推定已经死亡（报告的声音被吉他独奏的喧哗声盖住了）。虽然计划完全失败，但是这辈子值了。正在对 <?=player.name?> 启动最高优先级措施，为 <?=player:him_her()?> 建造一个体育场，让观众买票入场观看其霸气侧漏的情景。  关闭所有链接传送门，将所属的平台从大陆上分离，准备焰火，启动闪光灯和音响系统并——\n\n#{italic}#最后一个字歪歪扭扭，一条墨水细线向下划去直到页面的底部，那是笔从手上滑落留下的痕迹。下方是一幅关于你的涂鸦，手里拿着武士刀，正在和“忍者王阿塔玛森”对战。看起来，你的霸气侧漏把这个恶魔吓尿了。#{normal}#\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9eb86ad71ff7ad7b8b34dfced4252e2709e318456ae7fd5024b300296ed67df3","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"db6a09035acb91ad83f52073241a8d8f8b988ffec8b6c7ee44e32348b7896498","logical_entry_identity":"8009452c13abd70a5be104d192d14bfc050b0107d8d040429b58ffbeb949fafa","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"an uruivellas","source_tag":"_t","target":"一只乌尔维拉斯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"07fe8fdf2e78e6f939098030217b1e3c1e52a6c6d68738e81b2c692883c4c087","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"dbd1603a2542f3e5b028999145e875ae2cc12b4ffc23bd3927b518eae795e94b","logical_entry_identity":"58ec275cb40d4da4d357dc7f14e26003eef89ed106c989be1b49570933811cea","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"destroying the crystal","source_tag":"_t","target":"摧毁水晶中"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8e3d7a454dedb608188a18e3da2e23e3fdf0a30ef1274ac50311ae51570ab0bb","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"dc180fc0c424fb3dba44abb606550eaab34e741f5dcf7503d090a75e8852221f","logical_entry_identity":"49947c743315d3d09214b45842155e0cabbd7234c3a7ad641ee01be97249e58e","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"You revel in the heat of battle. Whenever an enemy damages you within melee range, you have a %d%% chance to counter with an attack for %d%% weapon damage.\n\t\tYou get once chance to deal this damage to a particular target each turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你沉迷于战争的狂热。当一个近身的敌对生物伤害你时，有 %d%% 几率自动反击，造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n\t此效果每回合对同一目标触发一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"63aab949b9443065bc052ad883f011835bda225c1464764ee829a43e2e99bdea","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision